Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: Community adaptation for samsung-r7 - desktop-shell (wayfire) mode
 Opt-in landscape desktop session for the r7 built on wayfire over the
 hwcomposer-patched wlroots. NOT enabled by default (phosh stays the shipped
 session); switch live with r7-switch-session. The config files (wayfire.ini,
 waybar, wayfire-test.service, r7-auto-rotate.service, r7-switch-session) ship
 inert in -configs; this metapackage only pulls the runtime stack
 (wayfire/waybar/fuzzel/foot/wlr-randr/iio-sensor-proxy).
 Notes: the 'decoration' plugin is deliberately omitted (it null-derefs the
 0.18-backport wlroots xdg lifecycle and crashes on toplevel map). Landscape
 rotation follows the accelerometer via r7-auto-rotate.service (net.hadess.
 SensorProxy -> wlr-randr --transform); no touch calibration matrix is used or
 needed, since wlroots already applies the output transform to absolute input
 devices internally (a matrix layered on top double-rotates touch).

